{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"You are an expert at world knowledge. Step back and paraphrase a question to a more generic step-back question, which is easier to answer.\n\nOriginal Question: Which position did Knox Cunningham hold from May 1955 to Apr 1956?\nStep-back Question: Which positions has Knox Cunningham held in his career?\nOriginal Question: Who was the spouse of Anna Karina from 1968 to 1974?\nStep-back Question: Who were the spouses of Anna Karina?\nOriginal Question: Which team did Thierry Audel play for from 2007 to 2008?\nStep-back Question: Which teams did Thierry Audel play for in his career?\n\nNow, generate the step-back question for: Estella Leopold went to which school between Aug 1954 and Nov 1954?"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"original_question":{"type":"string"},"abstract_question":{"type":"string"}},"required":["original_question","abstract_question"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}